<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us | BeautyTrend Daily</title>
    <meta name="description" content="About BeautyTrend Daily - Your modern digital destination for hair, nail, and beauty trend intelligence." />
    <style>
      :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #faf8f7;
        color: #202020;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
      .header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding: 16px 20px; }
      .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #111; text-decoration: none; }
      .logo span { color: #d65d7a; }
      .content-box { background: #fff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #eee5e2; }
      h1 { font-size: 36px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #111; }
      h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 28px 0 10px; color: #111; }
      p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #555; }
      .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #d65d7a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <a href="/" class="logo">BeautyTrend<span>Daily</span></a>
        <a href="/" style="color: #666; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">← Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <a href="/" class="back">← Back to Home</a>
      <div class="content-box">
        <h1>About BeautyTrend Daily</h1>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>BeautyTrend Daily</strong>, your premier online publication dedicated to delivering fresh, verified, and inspiring beauty trend intelligence.
        </p>
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Our mission is to help beauty lovers, salon professionals, and style enthusiasts around the globe discover what's next in haircuts, hairstyles, hair color formulas, nail art innovations, and aesthetic beauty routines.
        </p>
        <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
        <p>
          Every article published on BeautyTrend Daily is crafted with attention to practical styling advice, face-shape suitability, and realistic maintenance routines, accompanied by top video tutorials and high-resolution visual guides.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
